    "text": "<p>The domain of the function</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Domain of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the&nbsp;equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now the domain of the given function will be the intersection of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, domain is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>}</mo></math></p>",
